      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "VAPORIZE (3) found the going tougher but ran well to place over 450m at Ballarat (25.98) in Grade 5. Was a winner the start prior in easier at Ballarat. Yet to miss the placings from three starts out of this box. Makes plenty of appeal. EUREKA MAC (7) last appeared when too good (35.52) over 603m at Gosford on June 23. Resumes after finishing fifth (35.52) at Gosford over 603m five months ago. Solid record at the distance winning five races. Has a good overall strike-rate and can find the frame here. LUCKY SPIN (8) turned spotting a big start finishing fourth (28.56) last time in a Grade 5 at Bendigo. Worth following up. BACK TALK (1) is a last-start placegetter at this track and distance – sure to have admirers.",
